  "title": "Blue Cheese, Bacon and Pear Brunch Sandwiches",
  "description": "Always a popular combination, Bosc pear slices, crumbled bacon, and melted blue cheese top focaccia bread slices to make tantalizing broiled sandwiches to serve for brunch or a light supper.",
  "authors": [
